        <items xsi:type="form:Decoration">
          <name>StatusSynchronizationUnavailability</name>
          <id>209</id>
          <title>
            <key>en</key>
            <value>
Cannot start data synchronization.
Try again later or &lt;link ExpectSynchronizationCapability>wait for synchronization to become available...&lt;/></value>
          </title>
          <title>
            <key>fa</key>
            <value>
شروع همگام‌سازی داده امکان‌پذیر نیست.
بعداً دوباره تلاش کنید یا &lt;link ExpectSynchronizationCapability>منتظر در دسترس شدن همگام‌سازی بمانید...&lt;/></value>
          </title>
          <title>
            <key>ru</key>
            <value>
Невозможно запустить синхронизацию данных.
Повторите попытку позже или &lt;link ExpectSynchronizationCapability>ожидайте такую возможность...&lt;/></value>
          </title>
          <title>
            <key>tr</key>
            <value>
Veri senkronizasyonunu başlatmak imkansız.
Sonra tekrar deneyin veya &lt;link ExpectSynchronizationCapability>imkanı bekleyin...&lt;/></value>
          </title>
          <title>
            <key>vi</key>
            <value>
Không thể khởi động đồng bộ dữ liệu.
Hãy thử lại sau hoặc &lt;link ExpectSynchronizationCapability>đợi tính năng như vậy...&lt;/></value>
          </title>
          <title>
            <key>it</key>
            <value>
Cannot start data synchronization.
Try again later or &lt;link ExpectSynchronizationCapability>wait for synchronization to become available...&lt;/></value>
          </title>
          <title>
            <key>pl</key>
            <value>
Cannot start data synchronization.
Try again later or &lt;link ExpectSynchronizationCapability>wait for synchronization to become available...&lt;/></value>
          </title>
          <visible>true</visible>
          <enabled>true</enabled>
          <userVisible>
            <common>true</common>
          </userVisible>
